  "releaseNotes": "LC045 resolves the well-known symbols it compares against once per compilation instead of at each comparison. Every invocation in a file previously paid several GetTypeByMetadataName lookups before being rejected, so files with no EF code paid the most. Interleaved A/B: faster in five of six paired runs, by 14% on an invocation-heavy corpus. Diagnostics are unchanged.",
